      "next_action": "在确认 duration is not None 后累加 duration，使已知0也走累加路径。",
      "suggested_self_test": "用输入 `record_id,duration_minutes\\n1,0\\n2,30\\n` 调用函数，检查 known_minutes 为30且 known_duration_count 为2。"
